<title>USA: Imperial Credit sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Imperial Credit sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>TORRANCE, Calif. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Credit Industries Inc said Monday that its board of directors approved a two-for- one stock split of its common stock to be payable on October 22, 1996 to shareholders of record as of October 15, 1996.</p>
<p>As of September 30, 1996, the number of shares of common stock outstanding is 18,951,295.</p>
